WEBVTT

00:01.120 --> 00:02.060
Oof...

00:03.300 --> 00:05.760
Now, where's that key?

00:06.280 --> 00:07.620
There we go.

00:15.260 --> 00:16.700
Upsy-daisy...

00:20.010 --> 00:21.380
Ow!

00:26.750 --> 00:28.340
Man...

00:30.940 --> 00:32.850
And down.

00:37.600 --> 00:38.410
Hup...

00:44.810 --> 00:46.530
Off you go.

00:48.570 --> 00:50.230
And the other.

02:00.290 --> 02:01.470
Good stuff.

02:04.020 --> 02:08.610
What was Ms. Makima's deal again, anyway?

02:10.460 --> 02:11.850
Oh, well...

02:16.480 --> 02:19.200
Water... Water...

02:54.820 --> 02:58.740
Huh... It's Den-Den-Denji?

02:59.400 --> 03:02.030
What are you doing in my place?

03:03.810 --> 03:06.910
Did I bring you here?

03:08.040 --> 03:09.410
Huh?

03:09.940 --> 03:13.170
I'm so dizzy... What the hell?

03:15.300 --> 03:20.440
Y'know, I noticed you're 
head over heels for Makima.

03:20.440 --> 03:22.800
My head's spinning...

03:23.500 --> 03:26.860
You could do better than 
that bitch, seriously.

03:26.860 --> 03:31.640
You and Aki, fawning all over her!

03:32.180 --> 03:33.950
Ugh...

03:33.950 --> 03:35.230
Seriously!

03:35.230 --> 03:36.280
Moo-ve on!

04:09.050 --> 04:10.220
Wanna do it?

05:48.350 --> 05:52.030
Do... Do what?

05:54.240 --> 05:55.910
Have sex.

06:00.740 --> 06:01.590
Stick 'em up.

06:11.420 --> 06:14.320
There you go. Good boy.

06:14.320 --> 06:15.930
Is this a good idea?

06:16.630 --> 06:17.500
Good boy!

06:17.500 --> 06:20.520
I was supposed to have my 
first kiss with Ms. Makima.

06:20.520 --> 06:21.400
Good boy!

06:21.400 --> 06:23.520
This chick puked all over that.

06:24.160 --> 06:26.900
Can I really let her have my first time?

06:31.100 --> 06:32.320
Yes!

06:40.010 --> 06:41.740
There we go...

06:44.130 --> 06:47.170
Let's get these off, too.

07:00.190 --> 07:02.870
You got something in your pocket, here?

07:05.960 --> 07:08.740
A Chupa Chups?! Ew!

07:10.460 --> 07:11.860
Denji...

07:11.860 --> 07:13.240
Denji?

07:13.740 --> 07:16.220
Are you okay, Denji?

07:16.820 --> 07:18.700
Maybe you should get some fresh air.

07:29.920 --> 07:33.040
I bought some nausea medicine 
at the supermarket.

07:33.040 --> 07:35.380
Take it when you go to bed, 
along with some water.

07:38.120 --> 07:40.140
Ms. Makima, I...

07:41.330 --> 07:44.250
My first kiss turned out really shitty.

07:45.630 --> 07:48.620
Even if I kiss a bunch of girls from now on,

07:49.590 --> 07:55.620
am I gonna remember 
the taste of puke every time?

07:58.540 --> 08:00.120
Open your mouth.

08:11.630 --> 08:14.970
I doubt you'll ever forget 
how that puke tasted.

08:16.520 --> 08:18.010
But it's okay,

08:18.770 --> 08:23.980
because until you die, you're going to 
experience a lot of new things.

08:24.660 --> 08:27.560
And you won't have time 
to think about vomit.

08:28.840 --> 08:32.240
As for your first indirect kiss,

08:33.010 --> 08:35.360
looks like it tastes like 
a Cola-flavored Chupa Chups.

08:42.900 --> 08:47.230
Sorry, Pochita. 
You probably wanted to score.

08:47.750 --> 08:51.730
But I want the first time to be 
with Ms. Makima.

08:52.930 --> 08:55.410
So until I kill the Gun Devil...

08:56.820 --> 08:58.520
Until then...

09:07.060 --> 09:08.980
Good morning, Denji.

09:12.850 --> 09:15.070
Want some breakfast?

09:19.940 --> 09:22.990
Looking down on people 
while you eat makes food taste better.

09:23.760 --> 09:24.960
Denji,

09:25.730 --> 09:29.680
I was so drunk last night I blacked out.

09:30.500 --> 09:32.840
I didn't take advantage 
of you last night, did I?

09:32.840 --> 09:34.960
You think I want a piece 
of some pukey chick?

09:35.410 --> 09:38.060
My first time's gonna be with Ms. Makima.

09:40.440 --> 09:42.680
Well, that is a relief!

09:42.680 --> 09:46.300
They toss you in jail for doing 
that kinda thing with minors, y'know.

09:56.740 --> 09:59.260
You're an odd one, Denji.

09:59.260 --> 10:02.910
Most people would feel too awkward to eat 
after something like that.

10:04.420 --> 10:06.960
Who the hell turns down free food?

10:08.680 --> 10:11.570
So, you like Ms. Makima, too, right, Denji?

10:11.570 --> 10:12.590
I super like her.

10:13.690 --> 10:16.470
Would you still like her 
if her personality was shitty?

10:16.470 --> 10:17.470
I'd like the shit out of her.

10:21.930 --> 10:26.180
Perfect! I'm gonna get 
the two of you together.

10:26.990 --> 10:27.840
For real?!

10:28.270 --> 10:29.780
For really real.

10:29.780 --> 10:33.440
I propose we form a secret alliance, Denji.

10:34.010 --> 10:38.770
I'm gonna help you get together with 
Ms. Makima, so you help me get with Aki.

10:47.660 --> 10:49.160
What do you like about him, anyway?

10:49.160 --> 10:50.170
His face.

10:53.600 --> 10:55.570
All right. You're on.

10:56.100 --> 10:57.580
Let's do this alliance thing.

10:58.800 --> 11:04.000
So, starting today, we're not 
just coworkers, but friends.

11:09.440 --> 11:13.740
You should come over for breakfast every 
now and then. Bring the Fiend and Aki.

11:20.100 --> 11:22.490
I wonder if Ms. Makima would come, too.

11:35.150 --> 11:37.440
When are we supposed to arrive in Kyoto?

11:38.160 --> 11:40.160
About 30 minutes.

11:40.160 --> 11:41.880
I should buy a lunch at the station.

11:42.500 --> 11:44.530
You've got a lunch meeting at 1...

11:44.530 --> 11:47.510
I'll make sure to be hungry again by then.

11:49.120 --> 11:54.330
I hate meeting with the Kyoto bigwigs. 
They're so intimidating.

11:54.880 --> 11:58.180
A meal is better when you get to relax.

11:59.940 --> 12:03.060
Last night's drinks were very good.

12:38.540 --> 12:40.830
This is Team C. This is Team C.

12:40.830 --> 12:41.780
We are go.

13:44.440 --> 13:46.450
I wonder what that was.

13:46.450 --> 13:48.770
Your ignorance astounds!

13:48.770 --> 13:50.450
'Twas a taiko drum.

13:50.450 --> 13:51.600
Maybe some kind of festival?

13:51.600 --> 13:55.480
Did the two of you truly not mate last night?

13:56.990 --> 13:59.840
Denji's more of a gentleman 
than you'd think.

14:01.930 --> 14:04.550
I'm amazed you can eat 
the ramen at this joint.

14:04.980 --> 14:06.610
The taste don't bug you?

14:10.400 --> 14:11.370
Who's that?

14:11.780 --> 14:13.620
Tastes good to me.

14:13.620 --> 14:16.000
Do not speak to me so casually!

14:16.580 --> 14:19.360
Guess you can't tell good from bad 
when it comes to food.

14:19.910 --> 14:21.960
Figures, though...

14:21.960 --> 14:25.200
You eat crap from an early age,

14:25.200 --> 14:27.710
you're bound to have bad taste 
when you're grown.

14:28.740 --> 14:31.470
Hard to be happy with bad taste, too.

14:31.470 --> 14:33.420
I am perfectly happy!

14:33.420 --> 14:34.860
You guys wanna leave?

14:34.860 --> 14:37.730
My granddad was 
the sweetest guy in the world.

14:35.890 --> 14:42.400
Crab-Miso Fried Rice

14:35.890 --> 14:42.400
Pepper Steak

14:38.190 --> 14:40.700
Took me to fancy places 
with really good food.

14:42.400 --> 14:46.470
He was a yakuza, 
but he was still a good guy.

14:47.060 --> 14:51.660
Like a "necessary evil." 
That's what they woulda called him.

14:52.320 --> 14:55.840
Only ever killed a handful 
of women and children.

14:56.640 --> 15:00.000
Used to spoil me rotten with 
the money he made from dealing.

15:01.340 --> 15:05.750
Everybody loved him. 
He was the real model of a Tokyoite.

15:08.650 --> 15:11.090
You loved him, too, didn't you, Denji?

15:12.840 --> 15:14.790
What the fuck do you want?

15:14.790 --> 15:15.890
You know him?

15:16.340 --> 15:20.430
I hear the Gun Devil's after your heart.

15:30.150 --> 15:31.370
Topknot!

15:31.370 --> 15:32.030
Kon!

15:50.510 --> 15:51.880
Aki Hayakawa...

15:52.880 --> 15:56.580
You've certainly put something 
outrageous in my mouth this time.

15:57.800 --> 16:01.240
Neither human... nor devil.

16:14.860 --> 16:17.620
Power, stop Himeno's bleeding.

16:18.340 --> 16:19.410
A nail?

16:28.480 --> 16:29.380
Now!

16:32.190 --> 16:32.880
Three.

16:46.230 --> 16:47.020
Now!

16:48.860 --> 16:49.610
Two.

16:55.740 --> 16:56.360
Now!

16:58.930 --> 16:59.580
One.

17:03.990 --> 17:05.870
What kinda creepy shit is that?

17:05.870 --> 17:07.920
Curse, finish him!

17:08.700 --> 17:09.670
Zero.

17:38.280 --> 17:39.160
How is she?!

17:40.660 --> 17:43.120
In need of a doctor, I'd say.

17:44.130 --> 17:47.420
He had a gun.

17:48.180 --> 17:50.620
It should be impossible
for anyone but the police

17:50.620 --> 17:52.430
or Devil Hunters to get them in Japan.

17:53.170 --> 17:57.220
I hear the Gun Devil's after your heart.

17:59.220 --> 18:01.630
Our first priority is getting 
Himeno looked after—

18:01.630 --> 18:03.060
The Curse Devil.

18:03.970 --> 18:08.390
I guess getting hit by that nail 
enough times means you die?

18:09.340 --> 18:11.550
You've got some pretty good moves.

18:12.240 --> 18:13.440
Where did you come from?

18:13.820 --> 18:15.290
Are you working with him?

18:34.610 --> 18:36.160
Know why you lost?

18:36.160 --> 18:39.310
Underestimated him. Like, real bad.

18:39.310 --> 18:41.030
Better kill him this time, then.

19:14.960 --> 19:16.420
He's still alive, y'know.

19:17.080 --> 19:20.170
Those Devil Hunter suits are pretty sturdy.

19:20.170 --> 19:21.380
Finish him off.

19:23.220 --> 19:26.700
Don't worry about me. Help Aki.

19:26.700 --> 19:30.760
I can not. I couldn't even 
follow his movements.

19:31.710 --> 19:32.930
Ghost!

19:33.890 --> 19:37.910
No. That girl is dreadful.

19:56.030 --> 19:58.340
I'll give you everything I've got...

19:59.240 --> 20:01.950
So give me everything you've got.

20:22.460 --> 20:24.740
Aki can cry.

20:29.400 --> 20:33.350
Most Devil Hunters see so many 
people around them die,

20:33.350 --> 20:35.140
so often, their tears run dry.

20:36.380 --> 20:38.380
But Aki cries so easily.

20:39.300 --> 20:42.430
I used to think it was funny 
how he would cry in private,

20:42.430 --> 20:44.930
after the rookies he was looking after died.

20:47.010 --> 20:49.510
Having someone care for you 
enough to cry like that...

20:51.990 --> 20:53.310
must be nice.

21:01.160 --> 21:03.190
Hey! Little help here?!

21:24.170 --> 21:27.520
Don't die on me, Aki.

21:30.340 --> 21:32.910
So that when I die...

21:37.300 --> 21:38.850
You can cry for me.

21:40.150 --> 21:41.690
Snake: Swallow it whole.

21:53.870 --> 21:54.580
Leave.
